1-2.75 3.527 92 92 0 0 1-2.918 3.383 93 93 0 0 1-6.32 6.32 93 93 0 0 1-3.387 2.922 96 96 0 0 1-3.523 2.75 95 95 0 0 1-3.656 2.575 91 91 0 0 1-7.668 4.594 89 89 0 0 1-8.078 3.82 88 88 0 0 1-4.172 1.61 93 93 0 0 1-8.55 2.598 94 94 0 0 1-8.77 1.74 89 89 0 0 1-4.438.548c-1.48.144-2.969.258-4.457.328q-2.232.11-4.469.11m0 0\"></path></g><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m223.77 129.21 8.503 49.595-44.539-23.414-44.543 23.414 8.512-49.594-36.031-35.125 49.797-7.234 22.265-45.122 22.262 45.122 49.805 7.234Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"drop-shadow-sm\">Best for iPhone Users &amp; Sleep Tracking</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 flex justify-center\"><div class=\"relative h-72 md:h-80 w-full max-w-[320px] overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white border border-gray-100 shadow-sm\"><img alt=\"Apple Watch Series 11 GPS 46mm Smartwatch\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain p-3 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/199c9b1c147e1282ebe00b45a27385fab55341dd-1264x1500.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 bg-primary-50 border-l-4 border-primary p-4 md:p-5 rounded-r-xl shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info w-5 h-5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-black text-primary uppercase tracking-wider\">The Verdict</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-900 leading-relaxed font-medium text-sm md:text-base\">If you have an iPhone, this is simply the best smartwatch you can buy. The Series 11 finally hits the 24-hour battery mark, meaning you can actually use the new Sleep Apnea tracking without worrying about it dying overnight. Just don&#x27;t expect the multi-week battery life of a Garmin or Huawei.</p></div><div class=\"mb-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 via-amber-50 to-orange-50 p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-amber-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-gray-900 pb-2 border-b border-amber-200/50\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-400 to-amber-500 p-1 rounded-md shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-3 h-3 text-white fill-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm text-amber-700\">Highlights</h3></div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2.5 bg-white/70 rounded-md border border-white/50 shadow-sm text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-monitor w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"21\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"17\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg></span><span class=\"leading-snug\">46mm Always-On Retina Display</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2.5 bg-white/70 rounded-md border border-white/50 shadow-sm text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star w-4 h-4 text-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"leading-snug\">Sleep Apnea Notifications</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2.5 bg-white/70 rounded-md border border-white/50 shadow-sm text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-battery-medium w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 14v-4\"></path><path d=\"M22 14v-4\"></path><path d=\"M6 14v-4\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></span><span class=\"leading-snug\">24-Hour Battery Life</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2.5 bg-white/70 rounded-md border border-white/50 shadow-sm text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-4 h-4 text-yellow-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"leading-snug\">Fast Charge (15 mins = 8 hours)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2.5 bg-white/70 rounded-md border border-white/50 shadow-sm text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\"><span class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-droplets w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 16.3c2.2 0 4-1.83 4-4.05 0-1.16-.57-2.26-1.71-3.19S7.29 6.75 7 5.3c-.29 1.45-1.14 2.84-2.29 3.76S3 11.1 3 12.25c0 2.22 1.8 4.05 4 4.05z\"></path><path d=\"M12.56 6.6A10.97 10.97 0 0 0 14 3.02c.5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5s3 3.5 3 5.5a6.98 6.98 0 0 1-11.91 4.97\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"leading-snug\">Water Resistant 50m (Swimproof)</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-emerald-100\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-emerald-900 text-sm mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> The Good</h3><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">Seamless iPhone Integration</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">New &quot;Vitals&quot; App is excellent</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"\">Double Tap Gesture is handy</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"\">Comfortable &quot;Thin&quot; Design</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-rose-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-rose-100\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-rose-900 text-sm mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://ww