ld text-sm py-2 rounded-lg shadow-sm hover:bg-yellow-500\">Check Price <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden mb-12\"><div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50\"><h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-6 h-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100\"><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">Will Amazon.ae deliver during the New Year holidays in UAE?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Yes, Amazon.ae and Noon typically continue operations during the New Year break. However, &quot;Same-Day Delivery&quot; slots fill up fast in Dubai and Abu Dhabi. We recommend ordering by December 28th to guarantee arrival before January 1st.</p></div></details><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">Is it better to buy the S25 Ultra now or wait for the S26?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">The S26 Ultra is expected to launch in late January or February 2026. However, the S25 Ultra is currently seeing massive price drops. If you need a phone <em>now</em> for the new year, the S25 offers better value for money.</p></div></details><details class=\"group [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden transition-all duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-gray-900 font-bold group-open:bg-blue-50/30 group-open:text-blue-700 transition-colors select-none\"><h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-snug\">What is the difference between &quot;UAE Version&quot; and &quot;Global Version&quot;?</h3><div class=\"relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 md:w-8 md:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-50 group-open:bg-blue-600 text-blue-600 group-open:text-white transition-all duration-300 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-100 rotate-0 group-open:opacity-90 group-open:rotate-90 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-minus absolute w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 opacity-0 -rotate-90 group-open:opacity-100 group-open:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path></svg></div></summary><div class=\"px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">For tech like Samsung phones and DJI gimbals, the &quot;UAE Version&quot; is TDRA-approved and comes with a valid local warranty. &quot;Global Versions&quot; are often grey imports; they may be cheaper but usually lack warranty support and features like Samsung Pay.</p></div></details></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><div class=\"p-5 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-xs text-red-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Product Safety Disclaimer</span></div><p>While we select products with high safety ratings, always read the user manual and manufacturer&#x27;s safety warnings before use. Specifications (such as voltage or materials) may change without notice. <strong>TopTenUAE</strong> is not responsible for misuse of any recommended products.</p><div class=\"mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium\"><svg xml