le\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Will Amazon.ae deliver during the New Year holidays in UAE?\"},{\"_key\":\"f1eb70291072\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"62a430e8fff5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fdbce6e96770\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The S26 Ultra is expected to launch in late January or February 2026. However, the S25 Ultra is currently seeing massive price drops. If you need a phone \"},{\"_key\":\"ea5028fd4e10\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"em\"],\"text\":\"now\"},{\"_key\":\"1ad60dd1464c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" for the new year, the S25 offers better value for money.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"Is it better to buy the S25 Ultra now or wait for the S26?\"},{\"_key\":\"feb045bf0b5f\",\"answer\":[{\"_key\":\"397fd03fd491\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"82d4328eb480\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For tech like Samsung phones and DJI gimbals, the \\\"UAE Version\\\" is TDRA-approved and comes with a valid local warranty. \\\"Global Versions\\\" are often grey imports; they may be cheaper but usually lack warranty support and features like Samsung Pay.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"question\":\"What is the difference between \\\"UAE Version\\\" and \\\"Global Version\\\"?\"}],\"intro\":\"Ring in 2026 with the ultimate tech upgrade. From the noise-canceling Sony XM6 for your January travels to the Galaxy S25 Ultra for productivity, we’ve curated the top 5 gadgets in stock now on Amazon.ae and Noon. Perfect for the long New Year weekend in Dubai and Abu Dhabi.\",\"listItems\":[{\"_key\":\"71f11b9b599c\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best for 2026 Travel Goals\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/49c4ehH\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Sony\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Ear pads prone to staining (Silver model)\",\"No aptX Lossless codec support\",\"Bluetooth stability issues reported\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.4,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"HD Processor QN3 (7x faster than XM5)\",\"12-Microphone System\",\"30-Hour Battery Life\",\"New Foldable Design\",\"Multipoint Connection\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sony WH-1000XM6 black foldable headphones side view\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/aaf7ffe536e9ada28532b32ba76c7ce520462fb5-991x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":1122.4,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Industry-leading Noise Cancellation\",\"Folds compact for travel\",\"Extremely comfortable for long flights\",\"Quick Charge (3 mins = 3 hours playback)\"],\"rating\":4.4,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":1938,\"slug\":\"sony-wh-1000xm6-wireless-headphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Sony WH-1000XM6 Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones\",\"verdict\":\"The new king of silence. With 12 microphones and the QN3 processor, this is the absolute best choice for frequent flyers and open-office workers who need total isolation.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":1,\"whySelected\":\"The ultimate luxury tech gift. Unboxing these feels premium, and giving the gift of silence (especially for commuters or travelers) is priceless.\"},{\"_key\":\"1ddab023511a\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best for Long Weekend Entertainment\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4aPPPsO\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Sony\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"No Disc Drive (Digital Games Only)\",\"Mixed Reports on Missing Game Codes\",\"825GB Usable Storage (System takes some)\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Slim Compact Design\",\"1TB High-Speed SSD\",\"120fps @ 120Hz Output\",\"Includes FC26 (FIFA) Game\",\"UAE Version (Warranty Compatible)\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Sony PlayStation 5 Slim Digital Console FC26 Bundle (UAE Version) showing the white console, controller, and game packaging\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/4c1bb5d7f4c65833c10099d7e81d95a17bbf06ee-1500x722.jpg\"},\"price\":1699,\"priceTier\":\"Mid-Range\",\"pros\":[\"13% Off List Price (Great Deal)\",\"Silent & Fast Load Times\",\"Compact Size (30% Smaller than original)\",\"Haptic Feedback Controller Included\"],\"rating\":4,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":30,\"slug\":\"ps5-slim-digital-ea-sports-fc-26-bundle-console\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Sony PlayStation 5 Slim Digital Console – EA SPORTS FC 26 Bundle\",\"verdict\":\"This is the best value way to get started with the current generation of gaming. You get the updated \\\"Slim\\\" console design with 1TB storage and the latest football blockbuster. However, be aware that it is the \\\"Digital\\\" edition (no discs allowed), and you must verify the game code is included upon arrival.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":2,\"whySelected\":\"The ultimate holiday bundle for football fans, combining the PS5 Slim Digital console with EA Sports FC—making it one of the most affordable and modern entry points into next-gen gaming.\"},{\"_key\":\"755c709e66f7\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best for Productivity & Photography\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4seHIwq\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Samsung\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Call Recording Disabled (Region Lock)\",\"45W Charging (Slower than Chinese Rivals)\",\"High Price Tag\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.3,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"Snapdragon 8 Gen 4 for Galaxy\",\"200MP Main Camera\",\"Built-in S Pen Stylus\",\"Titanium Frame\",\"7 Years Android Updates\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"SamsuGalaxy S25 Ultra 5G (UAE Version) smartphone-in S Pen and 200MP AI camera \",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/3ef44e6ddc5bbd820f2fc562a53c23f144afffa5-1432x1443.jpg\"},\"price\":3199,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"TDRA Approved (Genuine UAE Warranty)\",\"Incredible Zoom & Stability\",\"Flat Display (Better for Screen Protectors)\",\"Galaxy AI Features Built-in\"],\"rating\":4.3,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":926,\"slug\":\"samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-5g-uae-smartphone\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra 5G (UAE Version)\",\"verdict\":\"The undisputed king of Android in 2025. The \\\"UAE Version\\\" ensures you get a valid local warranty and Samsung Pay support. While the S26 is on the horizon, the S25 Ultra remains a powerhouse with an incredible 200MP camera and the most mature AI features on the market.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":3,\"whySelected\":\"The premium choice for tech lovers. Prices have dropped significantly ahead of the S26 launch, making this the best time to buy the current flagship with a full UAE warranty.\"},{\"_key\":\"42cf9dcc71cf\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best for Capturing New Year Memories\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/4aixWmr\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"DJI\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"App not on Google Play Store\",\"Requires precise balancing\",\"Average battery life\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.2,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"3-Axis Stabilization\",\"Built-in Extension Rod\",\"Quick Launch (Magnetic)\",\"Side Wheel Zoom Control\",\"ActiveTrack 6.0\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"DJI OSMO Mobile 6 Smartphone Gimbal Stabilizer - Android and iPhone Gimbal\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/b770ff75a8ba8560ce7522e062ca7ae9bee95f2b-1333x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":345,\"priceTier\":\"Budget\",\"pros\":[\"Official Warranty Support\",\"Foldable & Lightweight (305g)\",\"Includes Magnetic Phone Clamp\"],\"rating\":4.2,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":25248,\"slug\":\"dji-osmo-mobile-6-gimbal\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"DJI Osmo Mobile 6 Smartphone Gimbal Stabilizer\",\"verdict\":\"The #1 Best Selling gimbal in the UAE for a reason. It is compact, comes with official DJI UAE warranty support, and the \\\"Platinum Gray\\\" finish resists stains. While the app setup takes a few minutes, the cinematic smoothness it adds to your videos is worth the effort.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":4,\"whySelected\":\"The #1 best-selling gimbal in the UAE. At just AED 345, it is the most affordable way to make your holiday videos look like professional cinema.\"},{\"_key\":\"75ca96b940ed\",\"badgeLabel\":\"Best for iPhone Users & Sleep Tracking\",\"customVerdict\":null,\"product\":{\"_type\":\"product\",\"address\":null,\"affiliateLink\":\"https://amzn.to/3MMo3Dz\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"brand\":\"Apple\",\"code\":null,\"cons\":[\"Requires Daily Charging\",\"Only works with iPhone (No Android)\",\"Scratch resistance is good, not perfect\"],\"country\":null,\"currency\":\"AED\",\"curriculum\":null,\"customerRating\":4.7,\"entityType\":null,\"feeRange\":null,\"heroFeature\":null,\"keyFeatures\":[\"46mm Always-On Retina Display\",\"Sleep Apnea Notifications\",\"24-Hour Battery Life\",\"Fast Charge (15 mins = 8 hours)\",\"Water Resistant 50m (Swimproof)\"],\"location\":null,\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Apple Watch Series 11 GPS 46mm in Space Grey Aluminium showing Sleep Score and Vitals app interface\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/199c9b1c147e1282ebe00b45a27385fab55341dd-1264x1500.jpg\"},\"price\":1699,\"priceTier\":\"Premium\",\"pros\":[\"Seamless iPhone Integration\",\"New \\\"Vitals\\\" App is excellent\",\"Double Tap Gesture is handy\",\"Comfortable \\\"Thin\\\" Design\"],\"rating\":4.7,\"realityCheck\":null,\"retailer\":\"Amazon.ae\",\"reviewCount\":66,\"slug\":\"apple-watch-series-11-gps-46mm-smartwatch\",\"specifications\":null,\"title\":\"Apple Watch Series 11 GPS 46mm Smartwatch\",\"verdict\":\"If you have an iPhone, this is simply the best smartwatch you can buy. The Series 11 finally hits the 24-hour battery mark, meaning you can actually use the new Sleep Apnea tracking without worrying about it dying overnight. Just don't expect the multi-week battery life of a Garmin or Huawei.\",\"website\":null},\"rank\":5,\"whySelected\":\"The #1 requested gift for iPhone owners. The new Series 11 brings meaningful health upgrades like Sleep Apnea detection and finally offers enough battery life to track sleep reliably.\"}],\"mainImage\":{\"alt\":\"Christmas 2025 Tech Gift Guide UAE featuring PS5 Slim, Samsung S25 Ultra, and DJI Osmo Mobile 6 with Dubai Burj Khalifa skyline\",\"url\":\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/2f0982accf0d10582b6e50fec9e35fb9be9503a8-1200x800.webp\"},\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-26T03:22:00.000Z\",\"seoDescription\":\"\",\"seoTitle\":\"Top 5 Tech Upgrades UAE 2026: New Year Gift Guide\",\"showAffiliateDisclosure\":true,\"slug\":\"new-year-tech-upgrades-uae-2026\",\"title\":\"New Year 2026 Gift Guide: Top 5 Tech Upgrades for UAE Shoppers\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-02T10:18:42Z\",\"relatedLists\":[],\"relatedProducts\":[]}}]]}],\"$L33\"]}]]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"link\",\"44\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.png\",\"type\":\"image/png\",\"sizes\":\"192x192\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"link\",\"45\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon-v2.svg\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"link\",\"46\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"sizes\":\"any\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"link\",\"47\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\"