 Dubai and Abu Dhabi.\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/new-year-tech-upgrades-uae-2026\",\"itemListOrder\":\"https://schema.org/ItemListOrderDescending\",\"numberOfItems\":5,\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/new-year-tech-upgrades-uae-2026#webpage\"},\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Sony WH-1000XM6 Wireless Noise Canceling Headphones\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/sony-wh-1000xm6-wireless-headphone\",\"description\":\"The new king of silence. With 12 microphones and the QN3 processor, this is the absolute best choice for frequent flyers and open-office workers who need total isolation.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/aaf7ffe536e9ada28532b32ba76c7ce520462fb5-991x1500.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Sony\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":1122.4,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/49c4ehH\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.4,\"reviewCount\":1938,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Sony PlayStation 5 Slim Digital Console – EA SPORTS FC 26 Bundle\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/ps5-slim-digital-ea-sports-fc-26-bundle-console\",\"description\":\"This is the best value way to get started with the current generation of gaming. You get the updated \\\"Slim\\\" console design with 1TB storage and the latest football blockbuster. However, be aware that it is the \\\"Digital\\\" edition (no discs allowed), and you must verify the game code is included upon arrival.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/4c1bb5d7f4c65833c10099d7e81d95a17bbf06ee-1500x722.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Sony\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":1699,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/4aPPPsO\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4,\"reviewCount\":30,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra 5G (UAE Version)\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-5g-uae-smartphone\",\"description\":\"The undisputed king of Android in 2025. The \\\"UAE Version\\\" ensures you get a valid local warranty and Samsung Pay support. While the S26 is on the horizon, the S25 Ultra remains a powerhouse with an incredible 200MP camera and the most mature AI features on the market.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/3ef44e6ddc5bbd820f2fc562a53c23f144afffa5-1432x1443.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Samsung\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":3199,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/4seHIwq\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.3,\"reviewCount\":926,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"DJI Osmo Mobile 6 Smartphone Gimbal Stabilizer\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/dji-osmo-mobile-6-gimbal\",\"description\":\"The #1 Best Selling gimbal in the UAE for a reason. It is compact, comes with official DJI UAE warranty support, and the \\\"Platinum Gray\\\" finish resists stains. While the app setup takes a few minutes, the cinematic smoothness it adds to your videos is worth the effort.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/b770ff75a8ba8560ce7522e062ca7ae9bee95f2b-1333x1500.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"DJI\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":345,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/4aixWmr\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.2,\"reviewCount\":25248,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Apple Watch Series 11 GPS 46mm Smartwatch\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/apple-watch-series-11-gps-46mm-smartwatch\",\"description\":\"If you have an iPhone, this is simply the best smartwatch you can buy. The Series 11 finally hits the 24-hour battery mark, meaning you can actually use the new Sleep Apnea tracking without worrying about it dying overnight. Just don't expect the multi-week battery life of a Garmin or Huawei.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/199c9b1c147e1282ebe00b45a27385fab55341dd-1264x1500.jpg\"],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Apple\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":1699,\"priceCurrency\":\"AED\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\",\"url\":\"https://amzn.to/3MMo3Dz\",\"priceValidUntil\":\"2027-02-04\",\"seller\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Amazon.ae\"}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.7,\"reviewCount\":66,\"bestRating\":5,\"worstRating\":1}}}]},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will Amazon.ae deliver during the New Year holidays in UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Amazon.ae and Noon typically continue operations during the New Year break. However, \\\"Same-Day Delivery\\\" slots fill up fast in Dubai and Abu Dhabi. We recommend ordering by December 28th to guarantee arrival before January 1st.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it better to buy the S25 Ultra now or wait for the S26?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The S26 Ultra is expected to launch in late January or February 2026. However, the S25 Ultra is currently seeing massive price drops. If you need a phone now for the new year, the S25 offers better value for money.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between \\\"UAE Version\\\" and \\\"Global Version\\\"?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For tech like Samsung phones and DJI gimbals, the \\\"UAE Version\\\" is TDRA-approved and comes with a valid local warranty. \\\"Global Versions\\\" are often grey imports; they may be cheaper but usually lack warranty support and features like Samsung Pay.\"}}]}]}0:{\"buildId\":\"0l0HEHUer7u9z1jFStNEN\",\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],\"$L3\"],[\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],\"loading\":null,\"isPartial\":false}\n3:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"w-full mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"top-ten\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"New Year 2026 Gift Guide: Top 5 Tech Upgrades for UAE Shoppers\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/top-ten/new-year-t